<title>FRANCE: BOLLORE H1 SALES RISE.</title>
<headline>BOLLORE H1 SALES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     11,443    vs   10,831</p>
<p>NOTE - Diversified group Bollore Technologies gave its restated sales figures in a statement. Turnover rose 5.6 percent on a like-for-like basis and confirmed the trend seen in the first quarter. Transport, up 4.4 percent, continued to show international growth. Tobacco grew 12 percent, with the second quarter holding the high levels seen in the first quarter. Films saw a recovery in Europe. Energy grew nine percent. It reported consolidatedf group turnover, on a provisional basis, at 11,471 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
